  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:#0050A8; font-size: 150%; color:#ffffff; margin:10px; border: none; text-align:left; padding:5px; padding-left:10px;\">Tim Bartel (User:Avatar)</div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#ddddff; color:#000000; margin:10px; padding:5px;\">\n<div style=\"float:right; color:#000000;\"><small>(<a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/de:Benutzer:Avatar\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:de:Benutzer:Avatar\">Hilfe, ich kann kein Englisch!</a>)</small></div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Short info about me</b></span>\n</p><p><span style=\"color:#000000\">I am the Director of <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Community_Central:International\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Community Central:International\">Community Development International</a> for <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/About\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:www:About\">Fandom</a>.</span>\n</p><p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Contact me</b></span>\n</p><p><span style=\"color:#000000\">You can contact me in several ways:</span>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color:#000000\">Talk page on central: <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/User_talk:Avatar\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:User talk:Avatar\">w:User talk:Avatar</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000000\">E-Mail: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"mailto:avatar@fandom.com\">avatar@fandom.com</a></span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p></div>\n<p><!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119145157\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 97/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensi